  +      where <built-in method get of dict object at 0x7f6ee9530a80> = {}.get\n\ntest_report.py:8: AssertionError\n=========================== short test summary info ============================\nFAILED test_report.py::test_report_format - AssertionError: 缺少 overview 总览\n1 failed in 1.08s\n\nREPORT {}\n ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356\nPAPER [versioned evidence retained separately]\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone\nRecent project tool results:\n[{\"tool\":\"update_plan\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{}},{\"tool\":\"run_command\",\"arguments\":{\"argv\":[\"python\",\"-m\",\"pytest\",\"-q\"]},\"result\":{\"rc\":1,\"stderr\":\"\",\"timed_out\":false,\"stdout\":\"F                                                                        [100%]\\n=================================== FAILU\\n[full record remains in run.log]\\n==========================\\nFAILED test_report.py::test_report_format - AssertionError: 缺少 overview 总览\\n1 failed in 1.08s\\n\"}},{\"tool\":\"read_file\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{\"path\":\"report.json\",\"file_hash\":\"ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356\"}},{\"tool\":\"read_file\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{\"path\":\"paper.json\",\"file_hash\":\"06555c84cc484e6dcef2a1488dcc63cceb470aa6bbed2a1e471759e72425d095\"}}]\nEvidence ev-0fae89961d303fffa5a6 | report.json | lines:1-1 | sha256=ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356\n{}\n\nEvidence ev-e1f0788ba35ab420a8a4 | paper.json | lines:1-12 | sha256=06555c84cc484e6dcef2a1488dcc63cceb470aa6bbed2a1e471759e72425d095\n{\n  \"title\": \"Agentic Large Language Models, a survey\",\n  \"arxiv\": \"2503.23037v3\",\n  \"version_date\": \"2025-11-22\",\n  \"pdf_pages\": 76,\n  \"required_pages\": [\n    1,\n    52\n  ],\n  \"text_extraction\": \"由 agent 调用 read_pdf.py，使用 pdftotext -layout 按 PDF 页序号提取文字；不预先提供 TXT。\",\n  \"pdf_file\": \"paper.pdf\"\n}\n"}]}], "model": "deepseek-flash", "max_tokens": 16384, "reasoning_ef