展被引文献；只收 LLM 方法，排除无 LLM 的多智能体工作。p.5 原文「The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.」\", ['ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2','ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5'], \"overview\")\nprint(n)\nr = recall(['ev-5803bf1c9a0002a5bd4f','ev-f5fa865a87a2cd077881','ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97','ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3','ev-0aaa960f62d9cf1689f1','ev-5ee42fcee0f3b22d5203','ev-4049593a30e2846f8394','ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa'])\nprint(r.get('queued_count'))", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'overview', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 619}\n46\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8596, "output_tokens": 1352, "total_tokens": 9948}, "is_final_answer": false}}
