ntic LLM，再用 snowballing 扩展被引文献；只收 LLM 方法，排除无 LLM 的多智能体工作。p.5 原文「The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.」', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2', 'ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5'], 'valid': True, 'request': 4}}, 'answers': {}, 'section_text': {}}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 7087, "output_tokens": 77, "total_tokens": 7164}, "is_final_answer": false}}
