neration. It uses a genetic algorithm approach with multiple\npopulations of candidate solutions (programs), which are automatically evaluated (using tools depending on\n\n                                                  Journal of Artificial Intelligence Research, Vol. 1, Article 1. Publication date: December 2025.\n"}]}], "model": "deepseek-flash", "max_tokens": 16384, "reasoning_effort": "high", "stop": ["Observation:", "Calling tools:"], "thinking": {"type": "enabled"}}, "chars": 24304, "content_chars": 23162, "course_content_chars": 24046}
