", "required": true, "page": 49, "valid": true, "atomic": true, "chars": 4295, "exposed": true}, {"id": "ev-42cada09d7411017eb46", "source": "paper.pdf", "version": "b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c", "locator": "page:50", "required": true, "page": 50, "valid": true, "atomic": true, "chars": 4663, "exposed": true}, {"id": "ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9", "source": "paper.pdf", "version": "b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c", "locator": "page:51", "required": true, "page": 51, "valid": true, "atomic": true, "chars": 3844, "exposed": true}, {"id": "ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3", "source": "paper.pdf", "version": "b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c", "locator": "page:52", "required": true, "page": 52, "valid": true, "atomic": true, "chars": 4072, "exposed": true}], "notes": {"overview": {"id": "overview", "content": "overview（pp.4-5）：能力分为 reasoning–acting–interacting 三类，三者层层递进并构成良性循环（推理技术支持更强 acting，助理的交互能力支持社会模拟，助理与社会实验的产出可回流做数据增强）。p.4 原文「The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed by the reasoning approaches (category 1) is used for increasingly intelligent acting by assistants.」检索方法：先用 Google Scholar 搜 Agentic LLM，再用 snowballing 扩展被引文献；只收 LLM 方法，排除无 LLM 的多智能体工作。p.5 原文「The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.」", "sources": ["paper.pdf"], "evidence_ids": ["ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2", "ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5"], "valid": true, "request": 4}}, "answers": {}, "section_text": {}}}
