red': True, 'page': 51, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 3844, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:52', 'required': True, 'page': 52, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4072, 'exposed': True}], 'notes': {'overview': {'id': 'overview', 'content': 'overview（pp.4-5）：能力分为 reasoning–acting–interacting 三类，三者层层递进并构成良性循环（推理技术支持更强 acting，助理的交互能力支持社会模拟，助理与社会实验的产出可回流做数据增强）。p.4 原文「The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed by the reasoning approaches (category 1) is used for increasingly intelligent acting by assistants.」检索方法：先用 Google Scholar 搜 Agentic LLM，再用 snowballing 扩展被引文献；只收 LLM 方法，排除无 LLM 的多智能体工作。p.5 原文「The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.」', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2', 'ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5'], 'valid': True, 'request': 4}}, 'answers': {}, 'section_text': {}}\n2\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8210, "output_tokens": 372, "total_tokens": 8582}, "is_final_answer": false}}
